**This file contains information on how to use the codes**

THE DementiaBand diagnostic test checks the different parameters of the project, including modem connection and trial sms sending. For this test, you have to connect the board to the laptop(RUN 1ST)
THE DementiaBand diagnostic 1 is a test that lets you see results of your tests without the laptop(IT LETS YOU SEE RESULTS VIA ONBOARD LED)(RUN 2ND)

**USE ONLY AFTER TOP CODES BOTH PASS WITH 10/10**
THE Final Code without The sms button is an alternative if you dont want an sms button
The final v2 code is the version with the sms button for easy resetup
